# Playwright E2E configuration — the gitignored copy is e2e/.env.development.
# `pnpm e2e:accounts` creates an organization admin and a member holding the
# CRM User role in the THROWAWAY organization iblai.env names (never main) and
# fills in the four PLAYWRIGHT_* values (the *_USERNAME values are emails).
# auth.setup.ts needs the admin pair; without the member pair the member
# journey (13) skips. The journeys write E2E-prefixed records to that
# organization and sweep them at the end of the run.
APP_HOST=http://localhost:3000
PLAYWRIGHT_USERNAME=
PLAYWRIGHT_PASSWORD=
PLAYWRIGHT_MEMBER_USERNAME=
PLAYWRIGHT_MEMBER_PASSWORD=
